NAME
    basic - the P8X BASIC interpreter

SYNOPSIS
    basic

DESCRIPTION
    Launches P8X BASIC, a small integer BASIC with string variables,
    functions, and data-file I/O. Type BYE to return to the OS. basic is
    a /bin program; SAVE/LOAD and data files use the shared filesystem,
    so programs and data are visible to dir and the other tools.

    See the P8X BASIC guide for the language reference.

EXAMPLES
    basic
    run /bin/basic.bin

SEE ALSO
    edit, run, save, load
